@title Feature Flags: Build or Buy
@subtitle Decision page for the Growth team at Pebble Bank
@author Growth team

We keep 140 flags in a config file, and a deploy takes 40 minutes just to flip one. We are choosing between LaunchDarkly, Unleash (self-hosted) and building our own.

## Comparison

table = Option,Annual cost,Setup time,Targeting rules,Audit log; LaunchDarkly,"$54,000",1 week,advanced,yes; Unleash,"$9,000 hosting",3 weeks,good,yes; In-house,no license cost,10 weeks,basic,would need building

## Recommendation

! Unleash. It covers our targeting needs, and its audit log satisfies the compliance team at a sixth of the cost of LaunchDarkly.

## Risks

- We own Unleash upgrades and uptime.
- None of the options has an SDK for our COBOL batch jobs.
